#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:4
msgid "Profiling Isaac Lab with Nsight Systems"
msgstr "使用 Nsight Systems 分析 Isaac Lab 性能"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:8
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports CPU and GPU profiling via **NVIDIA Nsight Systems "
"(nsys)** for runtime performance analysis. This can help identify GPU/CPU "
"bottlenecks and determine the best configuration for your environments and "
"tasks. Profiling adds modest runtime overhead and produces large output "
"files, so it's best suited to targeted investigations rather than long "
"unattended training runs."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持通过 **NVIDIA Nsight Systems（nsys）** 分析 CPU 和 GPU "
"的运行性能，帮助定位瓶颈，并为环境和任务选择合适配置。性能分析会带来一定运行开销，且输出文件较大，因此更适合针对性排查，而非长时间无人值守的训练。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:11
msgid "Common Use Cases"
msgstr "常见用途"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:13
msgid ""
"**My training iteration is slow** - capture 3-5 iterations to see whether "
"time is mostly spent on physics, rendering, env reset, observation, etc."
msgstr "**训练迭代很慢** ：采集 3–5 次迭代，查看时间主要花在物理、渲染、环境重置、观测还是其他环节。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Env init takes 40 seconds** - profile a single launch to see the import "
"times for each module, kernel compilation, etc."
msgstr "**环境初始化需要 40 秒** ：分析一次启动，查看各模块导入、核函数编译等耗时。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Which physics/renderer backend should I use?** - profile your task with "
"different backend combinations to find the best fit."
msgstr "**如何选择物理和渲染后端？** 使用不同后端组合分析任务，找到合适方案。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Are my GPU kernels efficient?** - dive into the CUDA rows in nsys to "
"identify when the GPU is idle (optimization opportunity)."
msgstr "**GPU 核函数是否高效？** 查看 nsys 中的 CUDA 行，定位 GPU 空闲时段，寻找优化机会。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Did my code changes make things slower?** - A/B profile comparison before "
"and after your change."
msgstr "**代码修改后是否变慢？** 对修改前后的性能分析结果进行 A/B 比较。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:21
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:23
msgid ""
"This section walks you through everything needed to capture your first nsys "
"profile."
msgstr "本节介绍首次采集 nsys 性能数据所需的完整步骤。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:26
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:28
msgid ""
"`Nsight Systems <https://developer.nvidia.com/nsight-systems>`_ - install "
"for your platform."
msgstr ""
"`Nsight Systems <https://developer.nvidia.com/nsight-systems>`_ "
"：安装适合当前平台的版本。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:29
msgid ""
"``nvtx`` Python package for source code instrumentation, installed into your"
" Isaac Lab environment:"
msgstr "用于源码插桩的 ``nvtx`` Python 包，安装到 Isaac Lab 环境："

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:37
msgid "Running a Profile"
msgstr "采集性能数据"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:39
msgid ""
"The following command shows how to capture a profile for the ``Isaac-"
"Cartpole`` task via the ``rsl_rl`` training framework with 3 iterations:"
msgstr "以下命令通过 ``rsl_rl`` 训练框架，对 ``Isaac-Cartpole`` 任务的 3 次迭代采集性能数据："

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:67
msgid "Flags:"
msgstr "选项说明："

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:69
msgid ""
"``-t nvtx,cuda`` - capture NVTX ranges (CPU swim-lanes) and CUDA activity "
"(GPU row)."
msgstr "``-t nvtx,cuda`` ：采集 NVTX 区间（CPU 泳道）和 CUDA 活动（GPU 行）。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:70
msgid ""
"``--python-functions-trace=...`` - the function annotations file; ships with"
" Isaac Lab."
msgstr "``--python-functions-trace=...`` ：函数注解文件，由 Isaac Lab 提供。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:71
msgid "``-o my_profile`` - output path; nsys appends ``.nsys-rep``."
msgstr "``-o my_profile`` ：输出路径；nsys 会追加 ``.nsys-rep`` 。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:74
msgid "Reading the Resulting Profile"
msgstr "查看性能分析结果"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:76
msgid ""
"Launch the Nsight Systems UI, go to **File > Open**, and select your "
"``.nsys-rep`` file that you generated in the previous step. Expand the "
"**Threads** section and the domain swim-lanes will appear as separate rows. "
"Clicking on a function will highlight related functions in other lanes. "
"Expand the **CUDA HW** row to cross-reference with GPU kernels fired during "
"that CPU range."
msgstr ""
"打开 Nsight Systems 界面，选择 **File > Open** ，打开上一步生成的 ``.nsys-rep`` 文件。展开 "
"**Threads** ，即可看到各个域的泳道，分别显示为独立行。点击函数，会高亮其他泳道中的相关函数。展开 **CUDA HW** 行，可对照查看该 "
"CPU 区间内启动的 GPU 核函数。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:78
msgid "Domain swim-lanes in nsys-ui"
msgstr "nsys-ui 中的域泳道"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:83
msgid "The Trace JSON"
msgstr "跟踪定义 JSON"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:85
msgid ""
"The trace definition file lives at ``scripts/benchmarks/nsys_trace.json`` "
"and defines metadata for the Python functions of interest in Isaac Lab. nsys"
" monkey-patches these functions to automatically emit NVTX ranges at "
"runtime."
msgstr ""
"跟踪定义文件位于 ``scripts/benchmarks/nsys_trace.json`` ，保存需要关注的 Isaac Lab Python "
"函数的元数据。nsys 在运行时动态替换这些函数，自动发出 NVTX 区间。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:87
msgid "Schema:"
msgstr "结构："

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:104
msgid ""
"After editing the JSON, run the sync test to confirm every entry resolves:"
msgstr "编辑 JSON 后，运行同步测试，确认每个条目都能解析："

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:112
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:114
msgid "**An expected domain doesn't appear in the timeline:**"
msgstr "**预期的域没有出现在时间轴上：**"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:116
msgid ""
"Confirm ``nvtx`` is installed in your Isaac Lab environment (``python -m pip"
" show nvtx``)."
msgstr "确认 Isaac Lab 环境已安装 ``nvtx`` （ ``python -m pip show nvtx`` ）。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:117
msgid "Make sure the function is actually called during the profiled run."
msgstr "确认被分析的运行过程确实调用了该函数。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:118
msgid "Verify the JSON entry by running the sync test (above)."
msgstr "运行上面的同步测试，验证 JSON 条目。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Sync test fails with an** ``AttributeError`` - a function listed in the "
"JSON no longer exists at the given path."
msgstr "**同步测试出现** ``AttributeError`` ：JSON 中列出的函数已不在指定路径。"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:122
msgid "Fix the path to point at the renamed function, or"
msgstr "将路径改为重命名后的函数路径；或"

#: source/how-to/profile_with_nsys.rst:123
msgid "Remove the entry if the function was deleted."
msgstr "如果函数已删除，则移除该条目。"

